wiredtiger
------------------------------------------
WiredTiger is an high performance, scalable, production quality, NoSQL, Open
Source extensible platform for data management.

Runtime requirements:
  cygwin-3.6.12-1
  liblz4_1-1.9.4-1
  libsnappy1-1.3.1-1
  libwiredtiger-devel-11.3.1-1bl1
  libwiredtiger11.3.1-11.3.1-1bl1
  libzstd1-1.5.7-1
  pkg-config-3.0.10-1
  zlib0-1.4-1

Build requirements:
(besides corresponding -devel packages)
  binutils-2.47-1
  cmake-4.4.5-1
  cygport-0.37.12-1
  gcc-core-14.4.0-1
  liblz4-devel-1.9.4-1
  libsnappy-devel-1.3.1-1
  libzstd-devel-1.5.7-1
  ninja-1.13.2-1
  zlib-devel-1.4-1

Canonical website:
  https://github.com/wiredtiger/wiredtiger

Canonical download:
  https://github.com/wiredtiger/wiredtiger/archive/refs/tags/11.3.1.tar.gz

-------------------------------------------

Build instructions:
  1. unpack wiredtiger-11.3.1-X-src.tar.xz
  2. if you use setup to install this src package,
     it will be unpacked under /usr/src automatically
        % cd /usr/src
        % cygport ./wiredtiger-11.3.1-X.cygport all

This will create:
  /usr/src/wiredtiger-11.3.1-X-src.tar.xz
  /usr/src/wiredtiger-11.3.1-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libwiredtiger11.3.1-11.3.1-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libwiredtiger-devel-11.3.1-X.tar.xz

-------------------------------------------

Files included in the binary package:

(wiredtiger)
  /usr/bin/wt.exe
  /usr/share/doc/Cygwin/wiredtiger.README
  /usr/share/doc/wiredtiger/LICENSE
  /usr/share/doc/wiredtiger/README

(libwiredtiger11.3.1)
  /usr/bin/cygwiredtiger-11.3.1.dll

(libwiredtiger-devel)
  /usr/include/wiredtiger.h
  /usr/include/wiredtiger_ext.h
  /usr/lib/libwiredtiger.dll.a
  /usr/lib/pkgconfig/wiredtiger.pc

